\title{Refining the grid}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{A fine spin field can be evaluated at coarse sites. A fine connection transports along the small edges that make up each coarse edge. Which integers agree when these site and edge data are compared?}

\p{Use a single positive integer refinement factor #{k}. The [momentum grid](fdip-013X) and its triangulation require each period to be at least #{3}. Restricting a character only requires positive periods.}

